{"id": "69716", "title": "相爱相杀", "author": "苏尔流年", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 31, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69716.htm", "intro": "世界上的女人纵有万般的姹紫嫣红，在傅青城眼中也不过两种，他女人和路人。\r\n 世界上有这样一种男人，你不小心爱过，就再也爱不了别人。对卫如苏而言，傅青城就是这样一种存在。宛若心口一粒陈砂，日久成珠。\r\n 亲爱的，请相信。在这个世界上，总会有一个人为你跋山涉水，排山倒海而来。那一刻，你会明白，纵使枯等成灰，燃尽宇宙洪荒，也抵不过白发苍苍前的那一句——我爱你。\r\n 站在黑白之巅的天之骄子VS涅槃重生的浴火凤凰，\r\n 星光璀璨之畔，倾城夜色之间，\r\n 爱如深海缓缓来。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69716", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子+第一章 T", "file": "10681739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10681740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10681741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10681742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10681743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10681744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10681745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10681746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10681747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10681748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10681749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10681750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10681751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10681752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "10681753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "10681754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章（已补齐）", "file": "10681755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外 那时纨绔(傅青城)", "file": "10681756.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章（已修）", "file": "10681757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "10681758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "10681759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二", "file": "10681760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "10681761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "1068